{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065361/block/singleImage/3276094/df/01M85PJE9S9RQ0M1JDTCRAY74Y.jpeg?updatedAt=1795487927\"/><p>青馬大橋發生車禍。 今日（24日）早上8時29分，青馬大橋往機場方向有3車連環相撞，包括一輛的士及兩輛私家車，有司機感到不適。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場， 現場交通受阻 運輸署宣布，因交通意外，青嶼幹線（青馬大橋）（往機場方向） 的快線仍然封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車，青嶼幹線下層（往機場方向）現已開放，現時上址交通擠塞。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:56.640108+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:38:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T19:17:33.607902+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:37:19.060584+00:00","content_hash":"4b6e5ce5ba1cee04f5539c40b87830fb97fbab78a2396c9b69c62e689733e140","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:56.640108+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}